    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d323">

                <pb facs="0886" n="672" sameAs="frus:frus1871/pg672"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 303.</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Riotte to Mr. Fish</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 80.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Legation</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Leon</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1871-06-15"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi>
                            15, 1871</date>. (Received July 14.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor of acknowledging the
                    receipt of your dispatches Nos. 52 and 53, of respectively April 26 and May 9
                    last.</p>
                <p>The inclosed correspondence explains itself, and requires no additional remarks
                    of mine.</p>
                <p>The parcel therein alluded to leaves with this dispatch, marked S. D.</p>
                <p>I have the honor, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C. N. RIOTTE.</signed></closer>





